msgid "Simplified Hibernate ORM with Panache"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Hibernate ORM is the de facto Jakarta Persistence (formerly known as JPA) "
"implementation and offers you the full breadth of an Object Relational "
"Mapper.\n"
"It makes complex mappings possible, but it does not make simple and common "
"mappings trivial.\n"
"Hibernate ORM with Panache focuses on making your entities trivial and fun "
"to write in Quarkus."
msgstr ""

